    "title": "Area farmers markets begin operating for the season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tony Krausz ,\n10 hours ago The farmers market season kicks off this weekend in Jefferson County with three markets set to open. Markets in De Soto and Festus are scheduled to begin operating on Saturday, and the Crystal City Famers Market is set to open Sunday. Five other markets in Arnold, Cedar Hill, Fenton, Hillsboro... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
